{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_04",
  "title": "复仇之魂",
  "storyCode": "TW-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "baba7d17600d10ca2633eafbadcba8a007e4f9d6577654305787fdf085da68d7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 4上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "......怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这真是......惨不忍睹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火灾，现场已经处理过了，时间也过了很久。但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里，罗德岛的物资箱，编号，日期，一应俱全......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里的灰尘很规则，曾经有个某个方形的物体放在箱子上吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "......也许是安托的工作牌，她不喜欢挂在身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "卡达干员，断崖干员，现在情况有变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerToken": "char_328_cammou",
      "operatorId": "char_328_cammou",
      "portraitKey": "char_328_cammou",
      "text": "这、这我也明白的啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerToken": "char_328_cammou",
      "operatorId": "char_328_cammou",
      "portraitKey": "char_328_cammou",
      "text": "既然灰喉姐和艾尔斯把我从山上救下来了，我一定会好好帮忙的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": "char_294_ayer",
      "operatorId": "char_294_ayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_294_ayer",
      "text": "不要叫我艾尔斯......唉，莱恩哈特到底和你们说了些什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": "char_294_ayer",
      "operatorId": "char_294_ayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_294_ayer",
      "text": "天灾造成的后果很严重，沃伦姆德现在不会好过，那里的天灾信使在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": "char_294_ayer",
      "operatorId": "char_294_ayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_294_ayer",
      "text": "如果是莱恩哈特或者地灵小姐在的话，至少情况不会这么糟糕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "假设是无意义的......我们应该做好最坏的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "驻扎在城镇外，你们俩会有困难吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerToken": "char_328_cammou",
      "operatorId": "char_328_cammou",
      "portraitKey": "char_328_cammou",
      "text": "完全没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": "char_294_ayer",
      "operatorId": "char_294_ayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_294_ayer",
      "text": "......我毕竟是天灾信使的专职护卫，而这一位干员是为了拍摄视频素材深入冬灵山脉然后迅速遇难的“天才儿童”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerToken": "char_328_cammou",
      "operatorId": "char_328_cammou",
      "portraitKey": "char_328_cammou",
      "text": "都这个时候了你也要损我的吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerToken": "char_294_ayer",
      "operatorId": "char_294_ayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_294_ayer",
      "text": "只是开开玩笑，不然......灰喉不会希望我们现在就冲进镇上砸开议事厅的大门，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "......抱歉，忍耐一下，我去确认一下安托的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "去去就回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......饥荒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "饥荒。饥荒会毁了所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你想问什么，沃伦姆德这样规模的城镇，当然有自给自足的能力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前提是大裂谷出现的那天，没有那么多源石从地下刺穿构造区，割裂地块，炸毁农田和供给设施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事实上，没有在商业区和城镇中心发生爆炸，已经是万幸了，但即使如此我们依旧损失惨重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "季节也很糟糕，已经入秋，我们的航线正在向冬灵山脉进发，今年的冬天会来得很早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们没有把这一事实告诉所有人，是不希望引发不必要的恐慌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后，我们被不知情的自己人捅了刀子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些叛徒......怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔佳娜带着年轻人去排查了，如果没有人带路，没人能够碰到动力炉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各个街道应该有自己的备用拖拉设备，情况如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这样行进速度太慢了，顶多只有其他城镇的八分之一，我们无法在冬天之前离开山脉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "粮仓不能出任何问题，加派人手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人手......哪怕是老人和孩子，只要还愿意拿起武器的，都已经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对粮仓出手，等同于杀死沃伦姆德所有的人！他们，他们再怎么也不至于......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别把他们想得太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——请说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "十二音街道，也就是隔离区，之所以那么萧条，也是因为......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果我说，单纯是因为感染者的人数问题导致配给缩水，你们信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你们信不信根本不重要，他们信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们要拆掉仓库的门，仔细检查每一颗谷穗，才会相信我们说的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，难道我们就要让他们拆吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果真的只是检查检查，我倒也乐意开诚布公，但不是每个人都打算看看就算了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使官方没有公告，聪明人也能从路线和时令推算出沃伦姆德将在冬天遭遇的大饥荒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们煽动，他们掠夺，今天的所作所为，只是为了部分人自己活下去，而让另一部分人饿死，说白了，就是在找借口抢劫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗德岛是感染者问题对策专家，我当然信，安托医生的专业和你们的战斗足以说明一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——这片大地上的难题，就只有矿石病而已吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......即使在这个场合，我也必须为安托发问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "那是一场谋杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——无关人士都出去！长官和罗德岛的二位有要事想谈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塞弗林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_068",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，交给你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......看来，这不是个可以放在台面上进行的话题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪种有关谋杀的话题可以放在台面上进行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "你们的隐瞒会招致恶果——不那么正式的用词，我现在就看你们很不爽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "罗德岛干员安托在沃伦姆德卷入一起谋杀事件殉职，我需要得到一个答复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......还有，根据那位清醒过来的感染者居民的证词，他们也在寻找“凶手”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许凶手就在他们之中，常见的挑拨伎俩，贼喊捉贼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但在我们讨论凶手之前，我想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——打住，你没必要说出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使是我也有良心不安的时候，如果你提出请求，会让我感觉很难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但沃伦姆德还要靠罗德岛解围，事到如今，已经没有难为你们的必要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......跟我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "这里是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如此草率的处理我感到很抱歉，但他们大都是感染者，只有摆放在这样的地下才能让其他人安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......很冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论何时何地，我都会确保这些制冷装置的运行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "很精致的法术，不亏是莱塔尼亚的士官长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......受害者，八名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沃伦姆德的四位居民，安托医生，还有三个来自外界的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "......塞弗林长官的儿子......托尔瓦尔德先生也在其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......塔佳娜把这件事也告诉你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我的失职......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "安托......你在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "你......你让我好找啊......蠢猫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奇怪......她是怎么辨认出......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "（塞弗林长官......我们，让她们独处一会吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": ".......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......她的强势时常让我忘记，她也只是个努力前进的小女孩，和塔佳娜差不多的年纪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "塔佳娜姐姐......她在强撑着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "啊——！您不该再抽烟了！我说过的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "吸烟会让您的支气管疾病更加——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "您、您难道——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你想到了。小狐狸，你比我想的还要敏锐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是现在，先帮我保密吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......好受点了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以你的年纪来说，很了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我知道现在我眼睛肿了，你是在讽刺我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "痛失好友还能保持这样的冷静，我没有什么可嘲笑你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......事情还没完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，事情还没完。现在，希望我们是一条战线了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "这是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城防法术发生装置L-44“留声机”的自律施术单元，简单来说，这就是凶器了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这种程度的破坏力在民间当然是非法的，但反过来说，只要是受过高等教育的莱塔尼亚人，就有办法驱动这枚核心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "过载，升温，爆炎，毕竟是城防设备的一部分，源石技艺工程很复杂，不是谁都能用得来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......就是这个东西，就是有人用这个东西，把安托给......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......我们要找出凶手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那之后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "那之后......我要他付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真意外，原来不安和悲伤过去了之后，你选择的是复仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_358_lisa",
      "portraitKey": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......我们不应该......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我当然知道，作为罗德岛的干员，凯尔希医生的学徒，我应该比谁都清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但唯独那个人——那个人必须接受审判！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "安托做了什么？她在帮助感染者，她在帮助他们！安托为什么要遭受这一切！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "至少——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_345_folnic",
      "portraitKey": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "至少......至少我想问问他......为什么要这么做......凭什么这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塞弗林长官，铃兰小姐，亚叶小——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......亚叶小姐已经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们已经见过面了......你的样子很慌张，又出什么岔子了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。在搜查的过程中，感染者又和普通人发生了冲突......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这次......代表们出面都安抚不了大家的情绪，他们嚷嚷着要和那些武装感染者宣战......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城镇的移动手段被大幅度控制，这意味着什么很多人都明白......他们忍无可忍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是、但是我们有新的发现......串通感染者的居民里有很多人并不是感染者，他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我已经猜到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_069#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_066",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冬灵人，该死的部族，他们又来纠缠沃伦姆德了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
